[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4208531427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118316#issuecomment-4208531427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118316","id":4208531427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc762Rfj","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-08T18:24:47Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T18:28:49Z","body":"Calling `free.call_deferred()` gives no warning/error but is wrong, `free` is a method, not a property.\nCalling `free().call_deferred()` gives the following error in 4.6.2:\n`Error at (6, 5): Cannot get return value of call to \"free()\" because it returns \"void\".`\n\nEdit: You probably wanna call `queue_free()`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4208531427/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4208574474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118316#issuecomment-4208574474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118316","id":4208574474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc762cAK","user":{"login":"phosxd","id":167900279,"node_id":"U_kgDOCgH0dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167900279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd","html_url":"https://github.com/phosxd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosxd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-08T18:30:26Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T18:32:05Z","body":"@notroid5 `free` is also a callable https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.6/classes/class_callable.html\nSo `free.call_deferred` is perfectly valid.\nAlso `queue_free` is a node-specific method, it will not work for all objects.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4208574474/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4208731198","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118316#issuecomment-4208731198","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118316","id":4208731198,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc763CQ-","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-08T18:47:55Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T18:52:27Z","body":"In that case, you should clarify your report (and the title). You mention `Object` in the description but only `Node` in the steps to reproduce.\n\n`free` may also be a Callable but `free.call_deferred()` is not, the equivalent would be `free().call_deferred` afaik.\n\nEdit: You also do not mention Callable at all in the issue, so not sure what the actual issue is.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4208731198/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4209029276","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118316#issuecomment-4209029276","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118316","id":4209029276,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc764LCc","user":{"login":"theraot","id":1212509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTI1MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1212509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot","html_url":"https://github.com/theraot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-08T19:27:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T19:31:13Z","body":"This has to be related to how `free` is bound.\n\n*To get this out of the way, `free.call_deferred()` is correct. Godot converts any method into a `Callable`, and you can call `call_deferred` on it. `free().call_deferred()` would be calling `free`, and then calling `call_deferred` on the returned value, which is `void`, so this wrong. Also, yes, the example uses a `Node`, but that does not mean other objects are not affected.*\n\nIt is not the GDScript parser, because we would have had the error in the editor. This made me think that perhaps it is something about the export templates, perhaps some conditional compilation around `free`. So I checked how it is bound: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9273a6a9a04d12299f05aa34606a1c386a00deda/core/object/object.cpp#L1905\n\nif you explore the code around that you will can see there, `free` is the only method in `Object` that is being bound with `add_virtual_method`. Let us check it out: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9273a6a9a04d12299f05aa34606a1c386a00deda/core/object/class_db.cpp#L1902-L1934\n\nThere we find conditional compilation. This code does a lot more when it has debug enabled than otherwise. Likely it was messed up by some commit... So git blame! It seems the most recent change was this: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/d237e31a892586abc0b3cdd253704a0dcda8715c - I doubt this is the issue, because it would be a more  systemic problem if its. Yet, the alternative is that this is a long standing issue, that had not been resolved. Somebody would have reported it, right?\n\nYes, this is a DUPLICATE!\n\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/73036\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103511 ERRATA: on closer inspection this seems to be a different issue\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102710\n\nSee also, perhaps related:\n\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/59364\n\nAnd we have two pull requests:\n\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108798 - this is hacky it treats free as a special case, I think `add_virtual_method` should be fixed\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103112 - this just removes the conditional compilation, it might be adding more than needed to the release build","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4209029276/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4229648234","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118316#issuecomment-4229648234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118316","id":4229648234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78G09q","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-11T15:12:33Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T15:12:33Z","body":"Closing as duplicate, thanks for reporting!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4229648234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]